A required struct whose fields are all optional, written as an empty body:
an empty body writes nothing, and nothing beneath is required to report, so
the struct itself is reported as one the lens does not produce.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	meta!: {
		note?: string
	}
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		id: v0_0.id
		meta: {}
	}
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	meta!: {
		note?: string
	}
}
-- out/error --
error[E0346]: ForwardLens produces nothing for meta, which v1.0 requires
 --> history/1.0.thema:8:1
  |
8 | ForwardLens: {
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: add meta: <mapping> to v1_0
